Add run-log viewer and Paste-again button to the app shell

The history store (JsonHistoryStore) and DictationPipeline.PasteAgainAsync
already existed but had no UI. This surfaces both:

- New RunLogPage lists persisted runs newest-first (timestamp, intent, app,
  status, cleaned + raw text) with Refresh and Clear (confirmation dialog).
- MainPage gains a "Run log" button and a "Paste again" button that re-pastes
  the last cleaned transcript; it enables once a completed run exists.

Inner loop GREEN at 186; app builds x86 clean.

